      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَعَهُ</span></b> : see 4, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدُعَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدُعَ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَاعَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُدُوعٌ</span>, <i>He became superlative in
