    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدِعَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَعَ</span></b> , <i>He
was,</i> or <i>became, fat.</i> (As, K.)

